### ========================================
### 可用流程列表测试
### ========================================

### 登录获取 Token（zhangsan - 员工角色）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "zhangsan",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {% client.global.set("user_token", response.body.data.token); %}

### 获取可用流程列表 - 默认分页（使用员工账号）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/available-definitions
Authorization: {{user_token}}

### 获取可用流程列表 - 指定页码和数量
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/available-definitions?pageNum=1&pageSize=5
Authorization: {{user_token}}

### 获取可用流程列表 - 未登录（应返回 401）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/available-definitions

### ========================================
### 新建并提交申请功能测试
### ========================================

### 登录获取 Token（zhangsan - 员工角色）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "zhangsan",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {% client.global.set("user_token", response.body.data.token); %}

### 提交申请 - 正常提交（请假流程 ID=1）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/instances
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{user_token}}

{
  "definitionId": 1,
  "formData": "{\"reason\": \"年假休息\", \"days\": 2}"
}

### 提交申请 - 流程不存在或已禁用
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/instances
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{user_token}}

{
  "definitionId": 999,
  "formData": "{}"
}

### 提交申请 - 审批人无法确定（例如：RELATIVE 策略但用户没有上级）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/instances
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{user_token}}

{
  "definitionId": 1,
  "formData": "{\"reason\": \"测试无上级情况\", \"days\": 10}"
}

### 提交申请 - formData 格式错误（非 JSON 字符串）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/instances
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{user_token}}

{
  "definitionId": 1,
  "formData": "这不是一个合法的JSON"
}

### 提交申请 - 未登录（应返回 401）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/instances
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "definitionId": 1,
  "formData": "{}"
}


### ========================================
### 新建草稿功能测试
### ========================================

### 登录获取 Token（zhangsan - 员工角色）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "zhangsan",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {% client.global.set("user_token", response.body.data.token); %}

### 新建草稿 - 正常创建（请假流程 ID=1）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/drafts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{user_token}}

{
  "definitionId": 1,
  "formData": "{\"reason\": \"家里有事\", \"days\": 2}"
}

### 新建草稿 - 流程不存在或已禁用
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/drafts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{user_token}}

{
  "definitionId": 999,
  "formData": "{}"
}

### 新建草稿 - definitionId 为空
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/drafts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{user_token}}

{
  "formData": "{\"reason\": \"测试\"}"
}

### 新建草稿 - formData 为空
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/drafts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{user_token}}

{
  "definitionId": 1
}


### 新建草稿 - 未登录（应返回 401）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/drafts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "definitionId": 1,
  "formData": "{}"
}

### ========================================
### 修改草稿功能测试
### ========================================

### 登录获取 Token（zhangsan - 员工角色）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "zhangsan",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {% client.global.set("user_token", response.body.data.token); %}

### 修改草稿 - 正常修改（假设草稿 ID=1）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/user/drafts/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{user_token}}

{
  "formData": "{\"reason\": \"生病\", \"days\": 3}"
}

### 修改草稿 - 草稿不存在
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/user/drafts/999
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{user_token}}

{
  "formData": "{}"
}

### 修改草稿 - formData 为空
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/user/drafts/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{user_token}}

{}

### 修改草稿 - 未登录（应返回 401）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/user/drafts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "formData": "{}"
}

